52
00:03:46,293 --> 00:03:47,240
What a relief.

53
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:50,777
Oh, there is one other thing that
happened that still has me concerned.

54
00:03:50,860 --> 00:03:53,997
I was out eating lunch when I
met this very strange fellow.

55
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:55,980
What was that, Mom?

56
00:03:56,420 --> 00:03:57,937
He spoke about odd things.

57
00:03:58,020 --> 00:04:00,957
He said to me what happened three
years ago isn't finished yet.

58
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:01,870
Huh?

59
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,677
And I know you may not believe this,

60
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:06,097
but this was the same exact
guy who three years ago was

61
00:04:06,180 --> 00:04:09,533
