67
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:19,550
Uh-huh.

68
00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:21,177
Well, of course he was a human.

69
00:04:21,260 --> 00:04:22,789
I was just playing around.

70
00:04:23,020 --> 00:04:25,217
There's no way it could
have been Mummymon.

71
00:04:25,300 --> 00:04:30,000
Or could it? Hey, Mom. What's
for dinner? Doofus! You're back.

72
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:31,157
Where were you, Saturn?

73
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:32,897
That's for me to know, not you.

74
00:04:32,980 --> 00:04:34,757
Those goggles are numbing your brain.

75
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:37,437
And now a follow-up to the
special report broadcast earlier.

76
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:39,777
Reports indicate that
at approximately 4 p .m.

77
00:04:39,860 --> 00:04:40,690
local time,

78
00:04:40,773 --> 00:04:42,177
the monsters that suddenly
appeared all over the

79
00:04:42,260 --> 00:04:45,017
world just as suddenly
disappeared without a trace.

80
00:04:45,100 --> 00:04:46,629
Details are still unknown.

81
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:48,640
That jerk!

82
00:04:48,740 --> 00:04:51,277
I can't believe he
picked her instead of me!

83
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,190
Hello?

84
00:04:52,420 --> 00:04:54,020
Ken, where have you been?

85
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:57,097
I was just hanging out
with a few of my friends.

86
00:04:57,180 --> 00:04:59,004
I was getting a little worried.

87
00:04:59,340 --> 00:05:01,458
I'm glad your home's safe and sound.

88
00:05:02,140 --> 00:05:03,316
Sorry I worried you.

89
00:05:03,500 --> 00:05:07,417
I know you're a responsible young man, but
next time call me if you're running late.

90
00:05:07,500 --> 00:05:08,760
I will. I promise.

91
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:10,320
You must be hungry.

92
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:12,557
I made some tuna casserole for dinner.

93
00:05:12,640 --> 00:05:13,470
Can I get you some?

94
00:05:13,553 --> 00:05:16,362
Sounds great, but I'm too
preoccupied to eat now.

95
00:05:16,860 --> 00:05:17,690
Maybe later.

96
00:05:17,773 --> 00:05:18,603
Thanks.

97
00:05:21,020 --> 00:05:21,850
Hey.

98
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:25,260
