so someone else could live.

114
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:05,790
Ah.

115
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:07,950
Mmm.

116
00:06:08,033 --> 00:06:10,000
There's nothing like home cooking.

117
00:06:10,300 --> 00:06:11,817
