118
00:06:11,900 --> 00:06:14,606
Go down to the store and
tell Dad to come eat.

119
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:15,750
I'm on it.

120
00:06:18,820 --> 00:06:21,260
Dad, sis, it's time for dinner. Okay.

121
00:06:23,580 --> 00:06:24,960
It's so peaceful here.

122
00:06:25,220 --> 00:06:27,697
