innocent people will get hurt.

142
00:07:01,740 --> 00:07:02,570
Mm-hmm.

143
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:06,557
Our Kunemon and Mamemon are still
on the prowl here in the real world.

144
00:07:06,640 --> 00:07:08,337
And your group has got to be ready.

145
00:07:08,420 --> 00:07:10,479
The whole world is counting on you.

146
00:07:10,740 --> 00:07:11,681
Good night, Mom.

147
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:14,917
