149
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:17,558
Good night, Wormon.

150
00:07:17,860 --> 00:07:18,820
Good night, Ken.

151
00:07:19,740 --> 00:07:22,020
I know I really did see something.

152
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:26,380
Jess, what was that shadow?

153
00:07:26,700 --> 00:07:29,040
Ken, what were you saying?

154
00:07:29,220 --> 00:07:30,897
It's really not important, Wormon.

155
00:07:30,980 --> 00:07:33,509
I think that we both
better get some sleep.

156
00:07:33,660 --> 00:07:35,425
Even my antennae are drooping.

157
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:36,661
Good night, Ken.

158
00:07:36,860 --> 00:07:37,978
Good night, friend.

159
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,920
Wow, Ken, we did it.

160
00:07:48,740 --> 00:07:50,040
Hey, get down!

161
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,437
You look like you saw a ghost.

162
00:07:55,520 --> 00:07:56,350
You all right?

163
