It was a dream.

164
00:07:58,280 --> 00:08:00,221
More like a really bad nightmare.

165
00:08:01,400 --> 00:08:03,860
I have a question for you. Ask away.

166
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:06,897
Did we travel together
about two years ago?

167
00:08:06,980 --> 00:08:09,417
We both went into the
DigiWorld Desert, didn't we?

168
00:08:09,500 --> 00:08:10,618
Don't you remember?

169
00:08:10,980 --> 00:08:11,980
No, not really.

170
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:14,440
Do you remember if I hurt my neck?

171
00:08:15,180 --> 00:08:16,474
Like it was yesterday.

172
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:20,357
You were hurting so much, and I had
no idea what was wrong with you.

173
00:08:20,440 --> 00:08:21,499
It was just awful.

174
00:08:21,960 --> 00:08:22,790
Hmm.

175
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:26,217
It's like I have amnesia, and I
can't even recall what happened then.

176
00:08:26,300 --> 00:08:27,897
That's probably for the best.

177
00:08:27,980 --> 00:08:30,377
