returned to the real world.

181
00:08:36,460 --> 00:08:37,290
And that's all of it?

182
00:08:37,373 --> 00:08:39,418
So you're just starting to remember?

183
00:08:40,260 --> 00:08:41,090
No.

184
00:08:41,220 --> 00:08:44,808
All my memories are fuzzy like
something's interrupting them.

185
00:08:45,020 --> 00:08:45,980
But I know.

186
00:08:46,300 --> 00:08:48,820
Something happened to me that day. I know.

187
00:08:48,980 --> 00:08:49,810
He's in there.

188
00:08:49,893 --> 00:08:50,723
Be patient.

189
00:08:50,806 --> 00:08:51,940
We're in no hurry.

190
00:08:52,260 --> 00:08:55,789
Well, we'd better report that
we've pinpointed his location.

191
