spotted over on the east side.

222
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:11,940
Get a camera over there.

223
00:11:19,860 --> 00:11:21,920
I'm Skullcetemon, a ghost Digimon.

224
00:11:22,160 --> 00:11:26,984
I see power and my special nail bone attack
always crushes whoever gets in my way.

225
00:11:27,400 --> 00:11:29,635
There's another one on the north side.

226
00:11:32,420 --> 00:11:34,557
Who are you calling at a time like this?

227
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:37,287
If only I could be in
two places at one time.

228
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,030
Digimon.

229
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:46,080
Armadimon, armor, Digimon.

230
00:11:47,380 --> 00:11:50,920
Digimon, digital monsters,
Digimon are the champions.

231
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:57,400
Armor, Digimon.

232
00:12:02,020 --> 00:12:04,900
Submarimon, reliable guardian of the sea.

233
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:08,540
Digimon, digital monsters,
Digimon. Digimon.

234
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:10,990
Digimon!

235
00:12:11,073 --> 00:12:11,920
Digimon!

236
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:13,080
Digital monsters!

237
00:12:13,280 --> 00:12:14,809
Digimon are the champions!

238
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:16,080
Digimon!

239
00:12:16,340 --> 00:12:17,340
Digital monsters!

240
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:18,969
Digimon are the champions!

241
00:12:23,700 --> 00:12:25,800
Digivolve into champion!

242
00:12:28,400 --> 00:12:30,500
Aramon Digivolve 2!

243
00:12:33,880 --> 00:12:35,580
Angemon! Digimon!

244
00:12:36,980 --> 00:12:38,760
Let's dive in!

245
00:12:41,460 --> 00:12:42,940
End of bait!

246
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:45,720
I'm gonna sink it!

247
00:12:50,420 --> 00:12:52,560
He's stronger than I thought!

248
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:54,620
