251
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:12,760
Digimon, Digital Masters,
Digimon are the champions!

252
00:13:18,500 --> 00:13:21,980
Digimon, Digital Masters, Zudomon!

253
00:13:23,420 --> 00:13:24,250
Digimon!

254
00:13:25,180 --> 00:13:27,040
Yeah, go Zudomon!

255
00:13:27,160 --> 00:13:28,200
Vulcan's hammer!

256
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:36,597
Go ahead, get him, Manjumon!

257
